(*\[Theta]S[2],z=scriptZ+\[Lambda] Log[q]*)
\[Theta]S[2][\[ScriptZ]_+\[Lambda]_ Log[q_],q_^$$n_Integer,order_]:=Module[{c,rmax,pairs},c=Pi I \[Lambda];
